@startuml
title Send Result / Stage / Failure Type - Direct Send Enum Names From Code

' 状态图保持默认黑白，不引入模块颜色。

legend right
  代码枚举节点直接显示真实来源：枚举类.枚举值
  示例：ConsumeDecision.ACK / SendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR
  LOGICAL = 查询、时间、次数、配置推导，代码枚举中不存在
  RUNTIME = 执行过程节点，代码枚举中不存在
  ACTION = repository / adapter 动作，不是状态枚举
  PROVIDER ACTION = Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ 原生确认动作
  PROVIDER CAUSE = Provider 原生返回或异常，不是统一状态枚举
  MESSAGE SEMANTIC = message-component 语义，目前不是持久化枚举
endlegend

state "VALIDATE\nSendStage.VALIDATE" as STG_VALIDATE
state "ENRICH\nSendStage.ENRICH" as STG_ENRICH
state "RESOLVE\nSendStage.RESOLVE" as STG_RESOLVE
state "SERIALIZE\nSendStage.SERIALIZE" as STG_SERIALIZE
state "SEND\nSendStage.SEND" as STG_SEND
state "CONFIRM\nSendStage.CONFIRM" as STG_CONFIRM
state "RETRY\nSendStage.RETRY" as STG_RETRY
state "COMPLETE\nSendStage.COMPLETE" as STG_COMPLETE

state "CONFIRMED\nSendStatus.CONFIRMED" as STATUS_CONFIRMED
state "FAILED\nSendStatus.FAILED" as STATUS_FAILED
state "REJECTED\nSendStatus.REJECTED" as STATUS_REJECTED
state "UNKNOWN\nSendStatus.UNKNOWN" as STATUS_UNKNOWN

state "NONE\nSendFailureType.NONE" as FAILURE_NONE
state "VALIDATION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR" as FAILURE_VALIDATION
state "SERIALIZATION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.SERIALIZATION_ERROR" as FAILURE_SERIALIZATION
state "ROUTING_ERROR\nSendFailureType.ROUTING_ERROR" as FAILURE_ROUTING
state "PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND\nSendFailureType.PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND" as FAILURE_PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND
state "UNSUPPORTED_CAPABILITY\nSendFailureType.UNSUPPORTED_CAPABILITY" as FAILURE_UNSUPPORTED
state "AUTHENTICATION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.AUTHENTICATION_ERROR" as FAILURE_AUTHN
state "AUTHORIZATION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.AUTHORIZATION_ERROR" as FAILURE_AUTHZ
state "NETWORK_ERROR\nSendFailureType.NETWORK_ERROR" as FAILURE_NETWORK
state "TIMEOUT\nSendFailureType.TIMEOUT" as FAILURE_TIMEOUT
state "INTERRUPTED\nSendFailureType.INTERRUPTED" as FAILURE_INTERRUPTED
state "BROKER_REJECTED\nSendFailureType.BROKER_REJECTED" as FAILURE_BROKER_REJECTED
state "CLIENT_ERROR\nSendFailureType.CLIENT_ERROR" as FAILURE_CLIENT
state "RETRY_EXHAUSTED\nSendFailureType.RETRY_EXHAUSTED" as FAILURE_RETRY_EXHAUSTED
state "RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR" as FAILURE_RETRY_EXECUTION
state "UNKNOWN_OUTCOME\nSendFailureType.UNKNOWN_OUTCOME" as FAILURE_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
state "UNKNOWN_ERROR\nSendFailureType.UNKNOWN_ERROR" as FAILURE_UNKNOWN

state "PROVIDER_RESULT\nRUNTIME\nProviderSendResult(status, failureType)" as R_PROVIDER_RESULT
state "BUILD_SEND_RESULT\nRUNTIME\nnew SendResult(...)" as R_BUILD_SEND_RESULT

[*] --> STG_VALIDATE
STG_VALIDATE --> FAILURE_VALIDATION : invalid options/envelope
STG_VALIDATE --> STG_ENRICH : valid

STG_ENRICH --> FAILURE_UNKNOWN : enrich exception
STG_ENRICH --> STG_RESOLVE : ok

STG_RESOLVE --> FAILURE_ROUTING : route missing
STG_RESOLVE --> FAILURE_PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND : provider missing
STG_RESOLVE --> FAILURE_UNSUPPORTED : capability missing
STG_RESOLVE --> STG_SERIALIZE : ok

STG_SERIALIZE --> FAILURE_SERIALIZATION : serializer fails
STG_SERIALIZE --> STG_SEND : wire message ready

STG_SEND --> R_PROVIDER_RESULT : direct sender
STG_SEND --> STG_RETRY : reliable sender enabled
STG_RETRY --> R_PROVIDER_RESULT : final retry result

R_PROVIDER_RESULT --> STG_CONFIRM : provider returned
STG_CONFIRM --> STATUS_CONFIRMED : status=CONFIRMED
STG_CONFIRM --> STATUS_FAILED : status=FAILED
STG_CONFIRM --> STATUS_REJECTED : status=REJECTED
STG_CONFIRM --> STATUS_UNKNOWN : status=UNKNOWN

FAILURE_NONE --> STATUS_CONFIRMED : only valid with CONFIRMED
FAILURE_VALIDATION --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_SERIALIZATION --> STATUS_REJECTED
FAILURE_ROUTING --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_UNSUPPORTED --> STATUS_REJECTED
FAILURE_AUTHN --> STATUS_REJECTED
FAILURE_AUTHZ --> STATUS_REJECTED
FAILURE_NETWORK --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_TIMEOUT --> STATUS_UNKNOWN
FAILURE_INTERRUPTED --> STATUS_UNKNOWN
FAILURE_BROKER_REJECTED --> STATUS_REJECTED
FAILURE_CLIENT --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> STATUS_UNKNOWN : last provider status UNKNOWN
FAILURE_RETRY_EXECUTION --> STATUS_FAILED
FAILURE_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> STATUS_UNKNOWN
FAILURE_UNKNOWN --> STATUS_FAILED

STATUS_CONFIRMED --> R_BUILD_SEND_RESULT
STATUS_FAILED --> R_BUILD_SEND_RESULT
STATUS_REJECTED --> R_BUILD_SEND_RESULT
STATUS_UNKNOWN --> R_BUILD_SEND_RESULT
R_BUILD_SEND_RESULT --> STG_COMPLETE
STG_COMPLETE --> [*]

note bottom
  当前代码的三个维度需要同时看：
  1. SendStage：定位流程阶段。
  2. SendStatus：最终结果。
  3. SendFailureType：失败/不确定原因。
  例如 VALIDATION_ERROR 是失败类型，不是 SendStatus；VALIDATE 是阶段，不是失败类型。
end note
@enduml
